arm64: dts: qcom: ipq8074: rename the NSS reserved-memory region

The NSS host driver's device tree (ipq8074-nss.dtsi) refers to the region by
label, and 7.3 ships the node without one.

Signed-off-by: Julius Bairaktaris <julius@bairaktaris.de>

--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/ipq8074.dtsi
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/ipq8074.dtsi
@@ -152,7 +152,7 @@
 		#size-cells = <2>;
 		ranges;
 
-		nss@40000000 {
+		nss_region: memory@40000000 {
 			no-map;
 			reg = <0x0 0x40000000 0x0 0x01000000>;
 		};
